    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see what you're saying about restorative justice, but isn't there a serious moral problem with just letting people off easy? Like, if someone commits a violent crime, doesn't a system that focuses on \"healing\" instead of actual punishment fail to respect the victim and the gravity of the crime? It feels like retributive justice is the only way to actually achieve true justice.",
